From 847fc09d1cfad70007b60831f4999fe8d071f097 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jason Chu <jchu@xentac.net>
Date: Sun, 12 Jun 2016 22:27:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] Swap min-width and max-width

---
